"Booking cancelled in %(channel)s with %(amount)s paid online. The payment "
"registered automatically is kept and no refund has been registered: review "
"the cancellation penalty and the refund."
msgstr ""
"Reserva cancelada en %(channel)s con %(amount)s pagados online. Se mantiene "
"el pago registrado automáticamente y no se ha registrado ninguna devolución:"
" revise la penalización por cancelación y la devolución."

