msgid "Price Rounding"
msgstr "Redondeo del precio"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_room_type__price_derivation_value
msgid "Price Variation"
msgstr "Variación del precio"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_room_type__price_derivation_type
msgid "Price Variation Type"
msgstr "Tipo de variación del precio"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_room_type__price_derivation_pricelist_ids
msgid ""
"Pricelists where the price is derived. Leave it empty to derive it in all of"
" them"
msgstr ""
"Tarifas en las que se deriva el precio. Déjelo vacío para derivarlo en todas"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_backend_extra__product_id
msgid "Product"
msgstr "Producto"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_backend__extra_fallback_product_id
msgid ""
"Product of the channel extras that have no product of their own, so the "
"folio total matches what the guest pays. Leave it empty to leave those "
"extras pending and report them on the folio."
msgstr ""
"Producto de los extras del canal que no tienen uno propio, para que el total"
" de la ficha coincida con lo que paga el huésped. Déjelo vacío para dejar "
"esos extras pendientes y avisar en la ficha."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_backend_extra__pms_property_id
msgid "Property"
msgstr "Hotel"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_wubook_backend_journal_ota__register_channel_payments
msgid "Register Channel Payments"
msgstr "Registrar pagos del canal"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_wubook_backend_journal_ota__register_channel_payments
msgid ""
"Register automatically, on this journal, the amount the channel reports as "
"paid online."
msgstr ""
"Registrar automáticamente, en este diario, el importe que el canal comunica "
"como pagado online."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_paid_registered
msgid "Registered from Channel"
msgstr "Registrado desde el canal"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_room_type__price_base_room_type_id
msgid ""
"Room type whose price is the base of this one in the pricelists without a "
"rule of their own for it"
msgstr ""
"Tipo de habitación cuyo precio sirve de base al de este en las tarifas que "
"no tienen una regla propia para él"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_room_type__price_derived_room_type_ids
msgid "Room types whose price is derived from this one"
msgstr "Tipos de habitación cuyo precio se deriva de este"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_room_type__price_derivation_rounding
msgid ""
"Round the prices derived by a percentage to a multiple of this value, e.g. 1"
" for whole amounts. Zero rounds them to the currency"
msgstr ""
"Redondea los precios derivados con un porcentaje a un múltiplo de este "
"valor, p. ej. 1 para importes enteros. Con cero se redondean a la moneda"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_backend_extra__product_id
msgid ""
"Service the extra is imported as. Leave it empty to keep the extra pending: "
"it is imported with the fallback product of the backend, if any, and "
"reported on the folio otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Servicio con el que se importa el extra. Déjelo vacío para dejar el extra "
"pendiente: se importa con el producto por defecto del backend, si lo hay, y "
"si no, se avisa en la ficha."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model,name:connector_pms_wubook.model_pms_service
msgid "Services and its charges"
msgstr "Servicios y sus cargos"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_payment_notes
msgid ""
"Technical field: last value of every kind of channel payment note posted on "
"the folio, so that re-imports do not repeat them."
msgstr ""
"Campo técnico: último valor de cada tipo de nota de pagos del canal "
"publicada en la ficha, para que las reimportaciones no las repitan."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The [Mirai] lines of the internal notes could not be updated. The details "
"are in the server log."
msgstr ""
"No se han podido actualizar las líneas [Mirai] de las notas internas. Los "
"detalles están en el registro del servidor."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The amount %(channel)s reports as paid online could not be registered "
"automatically (%(error)s). Review the payments of the folio."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido registrar automáticamente el importe que %(channel)s "
"comunica como pagado online (%(error)s). Revise los pagos de la ficha."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_payments.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The amount paid online (%(amount)s) exceeds the folio total (%(total)s): it "
"probably includes extras that are not in the folio."
msgstr ""
"El importe pagado online (%(amount)s) supera el total de la ficha "
"(%(total)s): probablemente incluye extras que no están en la ficha."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel changed the extra %(extra)s from %(old)s to %(new)s, but it is "
"managed by hand in this folio: review it."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha cambiado el extra %(extra)s de %(old)s a %(new)s, pero en esta "
"ficha se gestiona a mano: revíselo."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel changed the extra %(extra)s from %(old)s to %(new)s, but its "
"service could not be updated: %(error)s"
msgstr ""
"El canal ha cambiado el extra %(extra)s de %(old)s a %(new)s, pero no se ha "
"podido actualizar su servicio: %(error)s"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel changed the extra %(extra)s from %(old)s to %(new)s, but its "
"service was changed by hand or invoiced, so it was not updated: review it."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha cambiado el extra %(extra)s de %(old)s a %(new)s, pero su "
"servicio se cambió a mano o está facturado, así que no se ha actualizado: "
"revíselo."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel extras are in %(currency)s and the folio in %(folio_currency)s, "
"so they were not imported: %(extras)s."
msgstr ""
"Los extras del canal están en %(currency)s y la ficha en %(folio_currency)s,"
" así que no se han importado: %(extras)s."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel moved the stay of the extra %(extra)s, but its service is "
"invoiced, so it stays on the cancelled room: review it."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha movido la estancia del extra %(extra)s, pero su servicio está "
"facturado, así que se queda en la habitación cancelada: revíselo."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel moved the stay of the extra %(extra)s: its service is created "
"again as the channel sends it, without the changes made by hand (%(old)s)."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha movido la estancia del extra %(extra)s: su servicio se crea de "
"nuevo tal y como lo envía el canal, sin los cambios hechos a mano (%(old)s)."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel removed the extra %(extra)s, but its service was changed by hand"
" or invoiced, so it was kept: review it."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha quitado el extra %(extra)s, pero su servicio se cambió a mano o "
"está facturado, así que se ha mantenido: revíselo."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The channel split this booking into %(count)s folios and each one repeats "
"the extras of the whole booking, so they were not imported: %(extras)s. Add "
"them by hand to the folio they belong to."
msgstr ""
"El canal ha dividido esta reserva en %(count)s fichas y cada una repite los "
"extras de toda la reserva, así que no se han importado: %(extras)s. Añádalos"
" a mano a la ficha que corresponda."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:connector_pms_wubook.constraint_channel_wubook_backend_extra_backend_normalized_name_uniq
msgid "This extra is already mapped in this backend."
msgstr "Este extra ya está mapeado en este backend."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/common/wubook_backend_journal_ota.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To register channel payments, the OTA payment mapping needs an OTA and an "
"incoming payment method."
msgstr ""
"Para registrar los pagos del canal, la asignación de pagos de la OTA "
"necesita una OTA y un método de pago entrante."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_paid_registered
msgid ""
"Total amount registered automatically on this folio from what the channel "
"reports as paid online. It never decreases, so payments cancelled or edited "
"by the staff are never registered again."
msgstr ""
"Importe total registrado automáticamente en esta ficha a partir de lo que el "
"canal comunica como pagado online. Nunca disminuye, así que los pagos que el "
"personal cancela o modifica no se vuelven a registrar."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Upselling applied: %(amount)s (according to Mirai, the guest pays it at the "
"hotel)"
msgstr ""
"Upselling aplicado: %(amount)s (según Mirai, lo paga el huésped en el hotel)"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_folio__channel_extras_state
msgid "What the import did with each channel extra of the folio."
msgstr "Lo que hizo la importación con cada extra del canal de la ficha."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_pms_room_type__price_derivation_type
msgid ""
"Whether the variation is a fixed amount or a percentage of the price of the "
"base room type"
msgstr ""
"Si la variación es un importe fijo o un porcentaje del precio del tipo de "
"habitación base"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:connector_pms_wubook.field_channel_wubook_backend_type_ota__import_channel_notes
msgid ""
"Write in the folio internal notes what the channel passes through for "
"reception. Only Mirai passes any for now: the loyalty club membership and "
"the upselling the guest pays at the hotel."
msgstr ""
"Escribir en las notas internas de la ficha lo que el canal transmite para "
"recepción. De momento solo Mirai envía algo: la pertenencia al club de "
"fidelización y el upselling que el huésped paga en el hotel."

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "its price is negative"
msgstr "su precio es negativo"

#. module: connector_pms_wubook
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_pms_wubook/models/pms_folio/binding_channel_extras.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "the taxes of %(product)s are not included in its price"
msgstr "los impuestos de %(product)s no están incluidos en su precio"
